  Title: Use Unscaled Time
  Summary: Two pulsing squares. Pause sets Time.timeScale to 0.
  Watch: Unscaled, Scaled
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 787199169}
  - {fileID: 745822092}
  HowTo: In play mode press Pause / Unpause, watch, and press it again.
  Expect: While paused, Unscaled keeps pulsing and Scaled freezes. Unpausing lets
    Scaled carry on from where it froze.
