  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: 
  Title: 04  Playback and Interrupts
  Summary: 'Play mode only. Interrupt Others (STOP / COMPLETE, REPORT / SILENT),
    stopping, replaying, punch spam, chaining with On Complete, Kill On Disable and
    unscaled time. Enter play mode, then click the buttons on each tile in the Game
    view.


    <b>Using this board:</b> select a tile. Its Inspector shows these
    directions at the top, with Select buttons for the objects to watch, and its
    UI Animation Player underneath. Badges in a tile''s corner say what it needs:
    <color=#FF9E5E>PREVIEW</color> (the Play buttons, out of play mode), <color=#FF9E5E>PLAY
    MODE</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>INSPECTOR</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>SCENE VIEW</color>,
    <color=#FF9E5E>CONSOLE</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>POP-OUT</color> (an animation''s
    own window).


    In play mode: right-drag pans, the wheel zooms, Tab steps
    through tiles, Home shows them all.'
