  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: P7
  Title: Interrupting a chain with COMPLETE
  Summary: First (2 s) chains into Second. Report and Silent interrupt it with COMPLETE.
  Watch: A, B, the counter
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 900993402}
  - {fileID: 1229342417}
  - {fileID: 34745044}
  HowTo: 'In play mode: First, then REPORT half way. Reset. First, then SILENT half
    way.'
  Expect: 'REPORT: A jumps up and punches, the counter goes up by one (First''s On
    Complete ran), and Second is started then stopped at once - B doesn''t move.
    SILENT: A jumps up and punches, the counter doesn''t change, B doesn''t move.'
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
