  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Play mode only. Interrupt Others (STOP / COMPLETE, REPORT / SILENT), stopping,
    replaying, punch spam, chaining with On Complete, Kill On Disable and unscaled
    time. Enter play mode, then click the buttons on each tile in the Game view.


    <b>Using
    this board:</b> select a tile. Its Inspector shows these directions at the top,
    with Select buttons for the objects to watch, and its UI Animation Player underneath.
    Badges in a tile''s corner say what it needs: <color=#FF9E5E>PREVIEW</color>
    (the Play buttons, out of play mode), <color=#FF9E5E>PLAY MODE</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>INSPECTOR</color>,
    <color=#FF9E5E>SCENE VIEW</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>CONSOLE</color>, <color=#FF9E5E>POP-OUT</color>
    (an animation''s own window).


    In play mode: right-drag pans, the wheel
    zooms, Tab steps through tiles, Home shows them all.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
