  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: P1
  Title: Interrupt Others and Stop(complete)
  Summary: Play Travel (or Endless), then press another button while it runs. The
    white line says what happened, the yellow line what should have.
  Watch: Runner, DONE, the two lines
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1325249068}
  - {fileID: 945892879}
  - {fileID: 196248837}
  - {fileID: 1872947905}
  HowTo: 'Enter play mode. For each of the six end buttons: press Play Travel, then
    that button half way across; read the two lines; press Reset. Repeat with Play
    Endless.'
  Expect: Every time, the white line matches the yellow one. COMPLETE jumps to the
    end and shows DONE without the jingle; STOP stops where it is; SILENT never counts
    On Complete; an endless loop is never completed.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 1284
  StageHeight: 330
