  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: P2
  Title: 'Hover in and out: STOP vs COMPLETE'
  Summary: Each card grows on hover and shrinks on exit, over 0.6 s. Their Interrupt
    Others differs.
  Watch: Stop Card, Complete Card
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1841200943}
  - {fileID: 2103295077}
  HowTo: In play mode, move the mouse onto each card and off again quickly, before
    it has finished growing.
  Expect: Stop Card shrinks from however big it had got - smooth. Complete Card first
    jumps to full size, then shrinks - a visible pop. That's why hover pairs want
    STOP.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
