  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3269ab77e5738674b9fefab358f453ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: P4
  Title: Replaying a running animation
  Summary: Grow (3 s, Interrupt Others on COMPLETE) has no From. Pressing it again
    while it runs restarts it from where it is - its COMPLETE is about the others.
  Watch: Bar
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 51912058}
  HowTo: In play mode, press Grow, then Grow again half way.
  Expect: The second press carries on growing from where the bar had got to, slower
    now (the same 3 s for less distance). It never jumps to full first.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
